    "Filmstack" : {
      "comment" : "The name of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Filmstack is for personal, non-commercial use. There's no account, backend, or analytics. Your movie library is stored on your devices and, if iCloud is on, synced between them through your own iCloud account. Your TMDB token stays in this device's Keychain and isn't synced.\n\nThe Apple Intelligence features (moods, smart search, Smart Pick, photo lookup, recommendations and your year recap) run on your device. Some larger requests may use Apple's Private Cloud Compute, which processes them without storing your data or making it available to Apple. Nothing is sent to the developer." : {
      "comment" : "A long-form privacy notice for the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
